Elite Dangerous game data
-------------------------

edrockmaster/domain/engineering/catalogue.json holds game data of Elite Dangerous:
materials and their grades, engineers, blueprints and their ingredients, experimental
effects. This data is the intellectual property and copyright of Frontier Developments plc,
subject to its terms and conditions (https://www.frontierstore.net/terms-and-conditions/).
It is not covered by the plugin's licence.

The file is written by scripts/import_engineering_data.py from community sources, at the
commits it records:

- EDCD/FDevIDs (https://github.com/EDCD/FDevIDs): material.csv, engineers.csv.
- EDCD/coriolis-data (https://github.com/EDCD/coriolis-data): modifications/blueprints.json,
  modifications/modules.json, modifications/specials.json.

